 - [ ] `/odom` + `/wheel_vel` @100 Hz from SPEED + IMU yaw; time-jump guard; `/reset_odom`.
 - [ ] Sensor flags → `/mower_sensor_info` @33 Hz + `/bumper_cloud`; host-side estop/lift/stop/bumper cut-off in addition to MCU's.
